WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.821
Spark has several join strategies If one side is
small Spark

00:00:05.848 --> 00:00:10.863
may broadcast it to workers If both sides are large
the data may need to

00:00:10.877 --> 00:00:16.740
be shuffled by join key A practical habit is to
filter rows and select

00:00:16.753 --> 00:00:21.385
needed columns before a large join as long as doing
so preserves the correct logic
